“An Ordinance amending  Ordinance  No. 3419,  which  established a new compensation
schedule for members of the City Council of the City of Cheyenne, to clarify the manner in
which compensation is to be computed, and providing for an effective date.”  Mr. Valdez moved
to approve on third and final reading, seconded by Mr. Brown. Motion carried.  Voting “yes” --
